From 13fdefecdb1939b3b0f7d784983dbc34ce16e13a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Mar 2021 20:38:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Thread ScriptExecutionData to SignatureHash. (#112)

ScriptExecutionData contains codeseparator_pos and executed_script_hash, which is required for the BIP341 sighash.

Co-authored-by: Shammah Chancellor <schancel@users.noreply.github.com>

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: ead41e71bcfe73bfb27331753857578dd561cb58
Recorded-replay-commit: 0353523798c276e2be83982c3946ea85f6f0d251

